al privacy common? Not common but acceptable. Could be 3 = somewhat uncommon or unusual strategies that do not offend sensibilities. I'd say 3.\n\nimplementability: degree can be easily implemented. Differentially private logging mechanisms with secure multi-party computation is significant change, expensive/difficult. Not totally impossible. Level 2 = significant change, or expensive or difficult, but not totally impossible. Could be 2. Or 3 = some changes reasonably feasible. Secure MPC is hard. I'd say 2.\n\nNeed one sentence evidence each then score.\n\nReturn rating echo id.\n\nFormat: maybe JSON? The prompt says give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first and then \"<subscale>\". Probably output list.\n\nLet's produce:\n\nid: P2472\noriginality_evidence: ...\noriginality: 3\n...\n\nEnsure order.\n\nProvide concise one sentence evidence.\n\nLet's craft.\n\n",
